Changes: added symbol table, scan-time numbers, FSE view-ordering/T2-blurring simulation, EPI gradient waveform → k-space trajectory, derivation of the EPI pixel shift $\Delta f N_{PE} t_{esp}$ with a distortion simulation, N/2-ghost derivation/simulation/correction, isochromat simulation of gradient vs RF spoiling, Bloch steady-state bSSFP profile and banding images, a GRE-family contrast comparison, an extended steady-state MPRAGE model, vendor acronym table. Corrected: Philips FSE name (TSE, not TFE), RF spoiling is not used in GRASS/FISP, PSIF is T2- (not T2/T1-) weighted, spoiled GRE is not "pure" T1, swapped GM/WM T2 values and the meaning of `T_recovery` in the original MPRAGE code; typos ("refouces", "full spoil").*
